                            <comment id="16754742" author="rkondakov" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 08:46:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, Patch looks good, but there is a couple questions. Shouldn&apos;t we also clean a &lt;tt&gt;DataRegion&lt;/tt&gt; for &lt;tt&gt;TxLog&lt;/tt&gt; in &lt;tt&gt;MvccProcessorImpl#stopTxLog&lt;/tt&gt;? And why the check &lt;tt&gt;ensureNoVacuum()&lt;/tt&gt;  was removed on &lt;tt&gt;CacheMvccVacuumTest.java:130&lt;/tt&gt;? As far as I understood, vacuum should not be started on deactivated cluster. Or may be I missed something.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16758150" author="amashenkov" created="Fri, 1 Feb 2019 09:52:12 +0000"  >&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;I&apos;ve tried to cleanup&#160;&lt;tt&gt;DataRegion&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;for&#160;&lt;tt&gt;TxLog and saw few tests failures.&#160;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Let&apos;s&#160;make this within another ticket, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11170&quot; title=&quot;MVCC: TxLog data region can be cleaned if all mvcc caches gone.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11170&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11170&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The check&#160;&lt;tt&gt;ensureNoVacuum()&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;was removed due to a race between&#160;ensureNoVacuum() call and grid activation (auto-activation) that makes test flacky.&lt;br/&gt;
 Actually, second node start return control to test-thread and starts a new PME to activate cluster. So, test-thread can see node state &apos;before&apos; auto-activation as well as &apos;after&apos; auto-activation. First cache operation or node.cluster().active(true) will wait for activation and it safe to&#160;check ensureNoVacuum() after if, but not before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16758334" author="gvvinblade" created="Fri, 1 Feb 2019 14:13:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, merged to master, thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
